Table "instances" in the SRECDM repo oracle database has attributes: software_home, software_version and port.

Table "swinstances"

This directory contains scripts/programs to update software_home, software_version, port attributes of the instances

Instance type

ora    : Oracle db instance
ogg    : GoldenGate
gi     : Oracle GI
sp     : SharePlex




-- update Oracle database table 
-- ./srecdmmgr instance update --sw_attr_by_file  -f $datafile

-- update PostgreSQL database table
./pgcdmmgr instance update --sw_attr_by_file  -f $datafile



ansible-playbook with  "pbrun oracle"



